WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.846
Inventory total: one thousand four hundred fifty-four artworks.

00:00:03.876 --> 00:00:09.460
That count is a current internal record, not an independent valuation or audit.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:14.201
Each item's title, scene, condition, and provenance still require individual review.

00:00:14.301 --> 00:00:19.032
Physical ownership alone does not provide digital reproduction or distribution rights.

00:00:19.062 --> 00:00:23.793
The company plans to record physical ownership and digital-use rights separately.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:29.838
Only materials approved for the intended use may appear in digital products or advertising.

00:00:29.938 --> 00:00:35.522
The operating plan begins with condition checks, photography, and a unique inventory number.

00:00:35.552 --> 00:00:41.556
Protective cases and controlled storage are intended to reduce light, humidity, and contact damage.

00:00:41.586 --> 00:00:46.310
Conservation records will document what was done, when, and by whom.

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:50.320
Independent review may support authenticity, condition, and provenance checks.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:55.796
An appraisal is a dated opinion, not a price guarantee from the reviewer.

00:00:55.826 --> 00:00:59.678
Future sale prices, liquidity, and appreciation are not guaranteed.

00:00:59.778 --> 00:01:05.349
The planned three-thousand-yen support would pay for rights review, acquisition, care, and upkeep.

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:11.821
Supporters would receive five random pieces. We will use only material approved for digital use.

00:01:11.851 --> 00:01:16.971
The pieces provide no points, level, tournament access, cash value, or prize.

00:01:17.071 --> 00:01:21.801
Physical animation artwork may support exhibitions when rights and insurance allow.

00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:27.911
Any physical award must come from a sponsor. Laws, taxes, delivery, and rights need review.

00:01:27.941 --> 00:01:33.221
Audience response can inform future acquisition, but it does not establish market value.

00:01:33.321 --> 00:01:38.469
Any additional purchase requires a written purpose, budget, provenance, and condition review.

00:01:38.499 --> 00:01:43.207
The current equity seed budget excludes purchases of physical animation artwork.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:48.378
Any separate acquisition vehicle would require its own governance and investor review.

00:01:48.478 --> 00:01:53.201
The operating advantage is disciplined custody, rights control, and documented use.

00:01:53.231 --> 00:01:58.271
During the seed stage, we will test preservation work and products after legal review.

00:01:58.301 --> 00:02:02.596
We treat animation artworks as operating assets, not promised returns.
